  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on increasing the awareness and knowledge connected to nutrition. The three partners in Bangladesh, Cambodia and India will develop digital platforms to share skills on nutrition-sensitive activities and the implementation of these between nutrisionist experts from the three countries. Bangladesh, Cambodia, India.</narrative>
  </description>
